<title>HONG KONG: Merrill to set HK &amp; China Gas warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill to set HK &amp; China Gas warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Friday it intended to issue 300 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hong Kong &amp; China Gas Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$14.80	 PREMIUM	    16.35 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.242	 GEARING	    6.11x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  10.APR.98	SETTLEMENT DATE  04.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     05.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$14.80	 EXER LOT	   10,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
